    },
    "10+ years: Hair and skin patterns are fully mature. Scalp hair, if affected by androgenetic alopecia, reached its plateau long ago. Skin aging follows its normal course — sun protection and skin checks are the primary active steps." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "10+ years: Hair and skin patterns are fully mature. Scalp hair, if affected by androgenetic alopecia, reached its plateau long ago. Skin aging follows its normal course — sun protection and skin checks are the primary active steps."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "10+ years: Muscle mass is maintained by T but gradually declines with age regardless. Resistance training, adequate protein, and cardiovascular health are lifelong commitments. Your baseline is solid — protect it with consistency." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "10+ years: Muscle mass is maintained by T but gradually declines with age regardless. Resistance training, adequate protein, and cardiovascular health are lifelong commitments. Your baseline is solid — protect it with consistency."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "10+ years: Your body has been estrogen-dominant for over a decade. Bone health, metabolic rate, and muscle maintenance deserve active attention. Resistance training and bone-density monitoring (DEXA) are the cornerstones of long-term physical health." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "10+ years: Your body has been estrogen-dominant for over a decade. Bone health, metabolic rate, and muscle maintenance deserve active attention. Resistance training and bone-density monitoring (DEXA) are the cornerstones of long-term physical health."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "10+ years: Your brain has run on estrogen for over a decade. The neurochemistry is second nature. Age-appropriate neurological screening is what tracks cognitive health from this stage onward." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "10+ years: Your brain has run on estrogen for over a decade. The neurochemistry is second nature. Age-appropriate neurological screening is what tracks cognitive health from this stage onward."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "10+ years: Your skin has been estrogen-dominant for over a decade. The structural benefits (hydration, collagen, softness) are embedded. Age-related changes are universal — focus on skin cancer screening and gentle maintenance rather than chasing youthful texture." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "10+ years: Your skin has been estrogen-dominant for over a decade. The structural benefits (hydration, collagen, softness) are embedded. Age-related changes are universal — focus on skin cancer screening and gentle maintenance rather than chasing youthful texture."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "10+ years: Your voice is unshakeable — it's been set for most of a decade. No changes will occur. Any vocal work at this stage is about expression and confidence, not biology." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "10+ years: Your voice is unshakeable — it's been set for most of a decade. No changes will occur. Any vocal work at this stage is about expression and confidence, not biology."
          }
        }
      }
    },
