            "value" : "Adjust schedule"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After 5 years the skin baseline is well established. Estrogen's effects on skin do not reduce skin cancer risk." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "After 5 years the skin baseline is well established. Estrogen's effects on skin do not reduce skin cancer risk."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After a decade of estrogen-maintained skin, age-related thinning and dryness are typical and are not a sign that therapy has stopped working." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "After a decade of estrogen-maintained skin, age-related thinning and dryness are typical and are not a sign that therapy has stopped working."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After a decade the estrogen-dominant baseline is long established. Perimenopause-like changes can begin at an age-appropriate point." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "After a decade the estrogen-dominant baseline is long established. Perimenopause-like changes can begin at an age-appropriate point."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After a decade, age-related muscle loss (sarcopenia) begins for everyone, T or not. The best defence: consistent resistance training, adequate protein, and staying active. Your T baseline gives you an edge — use it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "After a decade, age-related muscle loss (sarcopenia) begins for everyone, T or not. The best defence: consistent resistance training, adequate protein, and staying active. Your T baseline gives you an edge — use it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After a decade, bone health is the most clinically relevant measure. DEXA scans track bone density directly; resistance training and adequate nutrition are associated with maintaining it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "After a decade, bone health is the most clinically relevant measure. DEXA scans track bone density directly; resistance training and adequate nutrition are associated with maintaining it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After a decade, dosing is maintenance. Periodic lab review is what confirms that ester, interval and levels remain appropriate as the body ages." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "After a decade, dosing is maintenance. Periodic lab review is what confirms that ester, interval and levels remain appropriate as the body ages."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After a decade, no further hormone-driven voice change occurs. Delivery, projection and singing remain trainable skills." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "After a decade, no further hormone-driven voice change occurs. Delivery, projection and singing remain trainable skills."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After a decade, your dosing is background rhythm. Labs every 6–12 months confirm stability. Unless you're experiencing symptoms, no adjustments are needed — your protocol is proven." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "After a decade, your dosing is background rhythm. Labs every 6–12 months confirm stability. Unless you're experiencing symptoms, no adjustments are needed — your protocol is proven."
          }
        }
      }
    },
