    "Pitch change is largely complete and is structural. Resonance and speech patterns remain trainable; pitch itself does not." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pitch change is largely complete and is structural. Resonance and speech patterns remain trainable; pitch itself does not."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pitch has been stable for half a decade. No further biological change is expected." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pitch has been stable for half a decade. No further biological change is expected."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pitch is permanent and will not change further. Voice training affects how the voice is used, not its pitch." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
