      }
    },
    "Year 2+: Body and facial hair are fully established and permanent. Scalp hair loss, if it was going to happen, has likely stabilised at its genetic baseline. Acne should be minimal by now." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Year 2+: Body and facial hair are fully established and permanent. Scalp hair loss, if it was going to happen, has likely stabilised at its genetic baseline. Acne should be minimal by now."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Year 2+: Muscle profile is stable. Gains beyond this point come from training stimulus rather than from time on testosterone, and lean mass is maintained by continued levels and activity." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Year 2+: Muscle profile is stable. Gains beyond this point come from training stimulus rather than from time on testosterone, and lean mass is maintained by continued levels and activity."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Year 2+: Your body shape is stable. Weight cycling (±5–10 lbs) will still produce new fat deposition in estrogen-dominant patterns. Muscle mass requires active resistance training to maintain — use it or lose it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Year 2+: Your body shape is stable. Weight cycling (±5–10 lbs) will still produce new fat deposition in estrogen-dominant patterns. Muscle mass requires active resistance training to maintain — use it or lose it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Year 2+: Your emotional landscape is fully established. You're reading from the same neurochemical playbook that cis women operate on — the brain has fully adapted to estrogen-dominant signaling." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Year 2+: Your emotional landscape is fully established. You're reading from the same neurochemical playbook that cis women operate on — the brain has fully adapted to estrogen-dominant signaling."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Year 2+: Your skin is estrogen-maintained at this point. It will stay soft and hydrated as long as levels remain in range. Age-related changes (fine lines, elasticity loss) will still occur — estrogen slows but doesn't stop the clock." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Year 2+: Your skin is estrogen-maintained at this point. It will stay soft and hydrated as long as levels remain in range. Age-related changes (fine lines, elasticity loss) will still occur — estrogen slows but doesn't stop the clock."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Year 2+: Your voice is permanent and settled. It will not revert if you pause or stop T. Vocal training can still improve resonance, projection, and control regardless of where your pitch landed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Year 2+: Your voice is permanent and settled. It will not revert if you pause or stop T. Vocal training can still improve resonance, projection, and control regardless of where your pitch landed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Year 5+: A decade of settled pitch. Your voice has been in its final range for years. Vocal quality (resonance, projection, clarity) can still be refined with training, but the fundamental frequency is permanent." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Year 5+: A decade of settled pitch. Your voice has been in its final range for years. Vocal quality (resonance, projection, clarity) can still be refined with training, but the fundamental frequency is permanent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Year 5+: Collagen density remains above what it would be without estrogen, but the natural aging timeline still runs. Fine lines and elasticity loss are normal. Retinoids, vitamin C and sun protection are the interventions with evidence behind them for this." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Year 5+: Collagen density remains above what it would be without estrogen, but the natural aging timeline still runs. Fine lines and elasticity loss are normal. Retinoids, vitamin C and sun protection are the interventions with evidence behind them for this."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Year 5+: Your emotional baseline is deeply ingrained. You've navigated years of hormone-steady cognition — trust your read of your own patterns. Annual mental health check-ins remain valuable, even when things feel stable." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Year 5+: Your emotional baseline is deeply ingrained. You've navigated years of hormone-steady cognition — trust your read of your own patterns. Annual mental health check-ins remain valuable, even when things feel stable."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Year 5+: Your hair pattern — body, facial, and scalp — has been stable for years. Any androgenic scalp loss has plateaued. Skin oil production may gradually decrease with age even on T. Dermatology screening (skin cancer) is a good annual habit." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Year 5+: Your hair pattern — body, facial, and scalp — has been stable for years. Any androgenic scalp loss has plateaued. Skin oil production may gradually decrease with age even on T. Dermatology screening (skin cancer) is a good annual habit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Year 5+: Your physique is established. T maintains lean mass but won't drive new growth without progressive overload. Cardiovascular fitness and metabolic health deserve equal attention alongside strength at this stage." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Year 5+: Your physique is established. T maintains lean mass but won't drive new growth without progressive overload. Cardiovascular fitness and metabolic health deserve equal attention alongside strength at this stage."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Year 5+: Your silhouette is fully estrogen-dominant. Bone density is protected by estrogen — but this protection depends on continued dosing. Weight-bearing exercise and adequate calcium/vitamin D become increasingly important in this decade." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Year 5+: Your silhouette is fully estrogen-dominant. Bone density is protected by estrogen — but this protection depends on continued dosing. Weight-bearing exercise and adequate calcium/vitamin D become increasingly important in this decade."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You know your rhythm. Energy peaks around day 2 post-shot, trough around day 6–7. Plan heavy workouts near peak, rest near trough." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You know your rhythm. Energy peaks around day 2 post-shot, trough around day 6–7. Plan heavy workouts near peak, rest near trough."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You've mastered your cycle. If you want even more stability, twice-weekly dosing flattens the curve and reduces aromatization spikes. Some providers are open to this — it's worth asking." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You've mastered your cycle. If you want even more stability, twice-weekly dosing flattens the curve and reduces aromatization spikes. Some providers are open to this — it's worth asking."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You've optimised. If not, twice-weekly dosing is the single best lever for smoothing out the peak-to-trough swing. It reduces both the T spike and the aromatization spike that follows." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You've optimised. If not, twice-weekly dosing is the single best lever for smoothing out the peak-to-trough swing. It reduces both the T spike and the aromatization spike that follows."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your biometric data doesn't match. Please try again." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your biometric data doesn't match. Please try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your body composition is fully adapted to sustained testosterone. The androgenic fat-distribution pattern and elevated baseline muscle mass are maintained for as long as levels stay in range — further change from here tracks training and age, not hormone tenure." : {
      "comment" : "Text displayed in the body insight for a user with 60 months on testosterone.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "Your body composition is fully established. Fat distribution patterns are maintained through ongoing estrogen — consistent levels prevent reversion to android-pattern storage." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your body composition is fully established. Fat distribution patterns are maintained through ongoing estrogen — consistent levels prevent reversion to android-pattern storage."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your body is still adapting to exogenous T. Aromatization patterns, energy fluctuations, and trough effects are all still emerging. Give it 3–6 months of consistent dosing to establish a clear pattern." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your body is still adapting to exogenous T. Aromatization patterns, energy fluctuations, and trough effects are all still emerging. Give it 3–6 months of consistent dosing to establish a clear pattern."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your brain's neural architecture has been androgen-adapted for years. The androgen receptor and local-aromatization signaling that shaped this adaptation continues to maintain it as an ongoing, active state." : {
      "comment" : "Long-term insight into the user's brain's neural architecture after 36 months of testosterone exposure.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "Your brain's neural architecture is fully adapted. Consistent hormone levels maintain ongoing neuroprotection, synaptic health, and emotional stability — a continuous, active state." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your brain's neural architecture is fully adapted. Consistent hormone levels maintain ongoing neuroprotection, synaptic health, and emotional stability — a continuous, active state."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your cycle is entirely routine by now. If you've already optimised, no changes are needed. The priority at this stage is lab monitoring, not schedule tweaking." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your cycle is entirely routine by now. If you've already optimised, no changes are needed. The priority at this stage is lab monitoring, not schedule tweaking."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your cycle is fully optimised by now. No changes are needed unless something shifts. Periodic labs to confirm levels remain in range are the only active monitoring." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your cycle is fully optimised by now. No changes are needed unless something shifts. Periodic labs to confirm levels remain in range are the only active monitoring."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your cycle is predictable. If aromatization symptoms at peak bother you, a slightly lower dose or more frequent injections can help." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
